ZINDAAN KE ZULMATOU MEIN SAKINA GUZAR GAYI<br>
<br>
 KYA KYA SITAM UTHAYE THE KARBAL SE SHAAM TAK,<br>
 KITNE TAMACHE KHAYE THE KARBAL SE SHAAM TAK,<br>
 WAADE MAGAR NIBHAYE THE KARBAL SE SHAAM TAK,<br>
 KITNA BULANDH SABR KA MEYAR KARGAYI<br>
<br>
EK SHAAM WA HUSSAIN KA BARPA THA QAID MEIN,<br>
 AUR DAM HAR EK BIBI KA GHUT TA THA QAID MEIN,<br>
 ALLAH KYA GAZAB KA ANDHERA THA QAID MEIN,<br>
 KUNBE KO QAIDE ZULM SE AZAAD KARGAYI<br>
<br>
BECHARGI HAI KHAUF HAI GHURBAT HAI YAAS HAI,<br>
 BACCHI KE KHUSHK HOTOU PA SHIDDAT KI PYAS HAI,<br>
 BEHRE KAFAN BADAN MEIN PHATA EK LIBAS HAI,<br>
 MANZAR YE SAARE RAAT NIGAHO MEIN BHAR GAYI<br>
<br>
BABA KE QATAL HONE KA MANZAR LIYE HUE,<br>
 NHANE SE DIL PA SADMAYE AKBAR LIYE HUE,<br>
 AANKHOU MEIN AANSU KE SAMADAR LIYE HUE,<br>
JO BEE RAHI THI QAID MEIN GHUT GHUT KE MARGAYI<br>
<br>
EHSAAS KI NIGAAH SEDEKHA HAI YE SAMAA,<br>
 QAIDE SITAM MEIN AAJ BHI BAITHI HAI BIBIYAAN,<br>
 AB TAK SUNAYI DETI HAI BACCHI KI HICHKIYAA,<br>
 HAR SAHEBE ZAMEER KO BEDAAR KARGAYI<br>
<br>
PATHAR LAHOO UGALTE THE LARZA THI KAYENAT,<br>
 AYI PAHAD BANKE YATEEMI KI PEHLI RAAT,<br>
WO GAAL PHOOL JAISE WO ZALIM KA SAQT HAAT,<br>
 HAIRAT HAIN KYUN NA PEHLE TAMACHE KE MARGAYI<br>
<br>
MUDDAT TAMAM HOGAYI BANO KE CHAIN KI,<br>
 AB TAK SADAYE ATI HAIN ZAINAB KE BAIN KI,<br>
 AHSAN WO CHAR SAAL KI BACCHI HUSSAIN KI,<br>
 TAZA LIYEE ZAMEER KA ELAAN KARGAYI